### ===== TOKEN SETUP =====
### Paste your tokens here after logging in (from auth.http)
### Format: @variable_name = token_value

@admin_token = 
@professor_token = 
@student_token = 

### ===== COURSE INSTRUCTOR ENDPOINTS =====
### This file contains all course-instructor-related requests with role-based access tests
### Token Variables: @admin_token, @professor_token, @student_token

### Admin: Get all course instructors (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get all course instructors (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get all course instructors (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Admin: Get course instructor by ID (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get course instructor by ID (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get course instructor by ID (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Admin: Get professor courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/professor/1/courses
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get professor courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/professor/1/courses
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get professor courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/professor/1/courses
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Admin: Create course instructor (ALLOWED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "professorId": 1
}

###

### Professor: Create course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 2,
  "courseId": 2,
  "professorId": 1
}

###

### Student: Create course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

{
  "id": 3,
  "courseId": 1,
  "professorId": 2
}

###

### Admin: Update course instructor (ALLOWED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "professorId": 2
}

###

### Professor: Update course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "courseId": 2,
  "professorId": 1
}

###

### Student: Update course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "courseId": 1,
  "professorId": 3
}

###

### Admin: Delete course instructor (ALLOWED)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Delete course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Delete course instructor (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/course-instructors/1
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

